# Cast — the Mods (order)
#
# Moderators carry an individual trust relationship with every guest and reward
# the loyal. They can't lock anyone down themselves — but drawing a mod's ire
# raises your heat, and heat is what the Algorithm acts on. Each is a
# `ModScanner(beat)` (badge + router); the two moderators keep their trust.

CHARACTER Moderator_Prime is ModScanner(mod_scan)
  trusts Guest: 50 of 100

CHARACTER Mod_Karen is ModScanner(mod_report)
  trusts Guest: 40 of 100

# Prop: the public scoreboard. Named performer: the in-world news anchor.
CHARACTER Leaderboard is ModScanner(the_leaderboard)
CHARACTER Newscaster is ModScanner(breaking_news)
